getMinchaGedolaGRAGreaterThan30
  name: Mincha Gedola (GR'A, Greater Than 30)
  category: MinchaGedola
  deprecated: false
  formula: MinchaGedolaGraGreaterThan30
  description: "Mincha gedola calculated as the later of mincha gedola GRA and 30 minutes after chatzos hayom.\n\nIn the winter, when half a shaah zmanis is less than 30 minutes, the 30-minutes-after-chatzos time is used. Otherwise, mincha gedola GRA is used.\n\nIn places where sunrise, sunset, or chatzos cannot be calculated, this zman may not be available.\n\nThis zman is calculated as though the configured location were at sea level.\n\nEach shaah zmanis is a twelfth of the whole day.\n\nChatzos is solar noon, when the sun crosses the meridian."
  description (flipped config): "Mincha gedola calculated as the later of mincha gedola GRA and 30 minutes after chatzos hayom.\n\nIn the winter, when half a shaah zmanis is less than 30 minutes, the 30-minutes-after-chatzos time is used. Otherwise, mincha gedola GRA is used.\n\nIn places where sunrise, sunset, or chatzos cannot be calculated, this zman may not be available.\n\nThis zman takes the configured location's elevation into account when it is calculated.\n\nEach shaah zmanis is a sixth of the afternoon, from chatzos to the end of the day.\n\nChatzos is the midpoint between sea level sunrise and sunset."

