getPlagHaminchaGRA
  name: Plag Hamincha (GR'A)
  category: PlagHamincha
  deprecated: false
  formula: PlagHamincha(ConfiguredSunrise, ConfiguredSunset, true)
  description: "Plag hamincha according to the [Vilna Gaon](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vilna_Gaon).\n\n10.75 shaos zmaniyos after sunrise, using a day from sunrise to sunset. \n\nThis is the earliest time Shabbos can be started.\n\nIn places where sunrise or sunset cannot be calculated, this zman may not be available.\n\nThis zman is calculated as though the configured location were at sea level.\n\nEach shaah zmanis is a twelfth of the whole day."
  description (flipped config): "Plag hamincha according to the [Vilna Gaon](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vilna_Gaon).\n\n10.75 shaos zmaniyos after sunrise, using a day from sunrise to sunset. \n\nThis is the earliest time Shabbos can be started.\n\nIn places where sunrise or sunset cannot be calculated, this zman may not be available.\n\nThis zman takes the configured location's elevation into account when it is calculated.\n\nEach shaah zmanis is a sixth of the afternoon, from chatzos to the end of the day.\n\nChatzos is the midpoint between sea level sunrise and sunset."

